# andronix desktop debian: starts Termux:X11 and the XFCE session. In the
# recording box, Xvfb stands in for the termux-x11 server (see README.md).
Output out/desktop.webm
Output out/desktop.mp4
Output out/desktop.gif
Source settings.tape

Type "andronix desktop debian"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 12s
Sleep 7s
Ctrl+C
Sleep 2.5s
